stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> Draft : Agent 产出代码/方案

    state "Pre-commit Gate" as PCG {
        [*] --> LintCheck
        LintCheck --> FormatCheck
        FormatCheck --> [*]
    }

    state "Test Gate" as TG {
        [*] --> UnitTest
        UnitTest --> IntegrationTest
        IntegrationTest --> [*]
    }

    state "Architecture Gate" as AG {
        [*] --> DepDirection
        DepDirection --> CircularCheck
        CircularCheck --> [*]
    }

    state "Security Gate" as SG {
        [*] --> VulnScan
        VulnScan --> SecretCheck
        SecretCheck --> [*]
    }

    Draft --> PCG
    PCG --> Draft : 失败，回退修复
    PCG --> TG : Lint + 格式通过

    TG --> Draft : 失败，回退修复
    TG --> AG : 测试全绿

    AG --> Draft : 失败，回退修复
    AG --> SG : 依赖方向正确

    SG --> Draft : 失败，回退修复
    SG --> [*] : 通过，合并到主分支
